er, bassist, and student of Computer Science & Artificial Intelligence at Tamkang University (淡江大學) in Taiwan.","”"]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"I grew up in Tangerang, Indonesia, immersed in school hackathons, drama productions ('Roda di Balik Gerobak'), robotics breadboards, and Tarakanita CC5+ values. Now based in Taiwan, I split my waking hours between mathematical tensor kernels, cascaded control loops, speedcubing algorithms, and the rhythmic crack of slap bass guitar against frets."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"I don't fit neatly into the modern developer archetype. I don't care about startup valuations, aesthetic corporate roadmaps, or building another CRUD wrapper around someone else's closed API. I care about what happens when the voltage hits the motor coil, when the matrix product fits inside L2 cache, and when a machine behaves with genuine physical elegance."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","section","1",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start border-b border-ink-dark/15 dark:border-paper-100/15 pb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-4 space-y-1 font-mono","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-accent font-bold tracking-widest uppercase","children":"02 // ARTIFACTS"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-50 tracking-tight","children":"WHAT I MAKE"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-8 space-y-4 font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-dark/90 dark:text-paper-100/90 leading-relaxed font-light","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-medium text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-50 text-lg sm:text-xl italic font-serif","children":["“","Things with tactile feedback, zero-dependency resilience, and low-latency mechanical truth.","”"]}],"$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3 pt-2 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-100","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"dual-loop-controller: A Python package published on PyPI (v2.5.0) implementing nested cascaded PID control for high-precision robotics and physical actuators."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"PENJAGA-MOBILE: An off-grid civilian emergency mesh network communicating via Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) packet hops during disaster blackouts."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Block Blast CV Solver: An automated computer vision pipeline using OpenCV and ADB to scan, evaluate, and inject real-time tile placement taps at 60 FPS."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Heterogeneous Cross-Play Minecraft Cluster: A high-throughput Paper/Spigot distributed game infrastructure bridging Java and Bedrock clients via custom UDP packet translation."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Grouped-Subspace Latent MoE Routing: Sparse Small Language Model architectures engineered to reason locally on 15W laptop NPU silicon with custom PyTorch and Triton kernels."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start border-b border-ink-dark/15 dark:border-paper-100/15 pb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-4 space-y-1 font-mono","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-accent font-bold tracking-widest uppercase","children":"03 // CONVICTIONS"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-50 tracking-tight","children":"WHAT I BELIEVE"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-8 space-y-4 font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-dark/90 dark:text-paper-100/90 leading-relaxed font-light","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-medium text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-50 text-lg sm:text-xl italic font-serif","children":["“","Engineering is a moral discipline, not a spectacle.","”"]}],"$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3 pt-2 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-100","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Small models over bloated monoliths. An intelligence that runs locally on battery power is sovereign; an intelligence leased through a token API is just a fragile rental."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"If you don't understand the physical constraints of your hardware, your software is an accident waiting to fail."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Friction is healthy. Autocomplete and AI code generators that write boilerplate before you think are making programmers illiterate to edge cases."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Tarakanita CC5+ ethos: Competence without Compassion is dangerous; Creativity without Conviction is hollow."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"True polish is not adding features. True polish is stripping away every layer of abstraction until only the raw, humming math remains."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","3",{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start border-b border-ink-dark/15 dark:border-paper-100/15 pb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-4 space-y-1 font-mono","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-accent font-bold tracking-widest uppercase","children":"04 // IN PROGRESS"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-50 tracking-tight","children":"WHAT I'M LEARNING"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"md:col-span-8 space-y-4 font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-dark/90 dark:text-paper-100/90 leading-relaxed font-light","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-medium text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-50 text-lg sm:text-xl italic font-serif","children":["“","The edge of current comprehension.","”"]}],"$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3 pt-2 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-dark dark:text-paper-100","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Continuous learning mechanisms in sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) routing without catastrophic forgetting."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Writing custom Triton / C++ CUDA kernels for low-rank grouped attention directly addressing memory bus bandwidth bottlenecks."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-bold","children":"§"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Traditional Chinese character philology (繁體字) — understanding how archaic radical structures balance spatial weight."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className"